          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**CarScrub** makes the **CarPlay Now Playing** progress bar **scrubbable**. There is **no Settings pane** — install it and reconnect CarPlay.\n\nA white thumb appears on the bar. Drag and release to seek, even when an app (YouTube and others) disables native scrubbing.\n\nIf you like CarScrub, donations via [PayPal](https://www.paypal.me/DevDcsyhi) and follows on [X](https://twitter.com/intent/follow?screen_name=linux_n1) are appreciated.",
